                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ee9f4aba-1e0e-36d5-bd8d-74f7e3617841",
                        "entry_id": "16b04fd1-09f5-35d8-b3b0-c4d683154de8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "człowiek sceptyczny, wątpiący, niedowierzający"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "70b69b4a-c3ed-4c6b-b8cf-28051158850a",
                                "sense_id": "ee9f4aba-1e0e-36d5-bd8d-74f7e3617841",
                                "text": "Wyznawcą jest się we wspólnocie, ateistą i sceptykiem jest się zaś wyłącznie na własny rachunek, co bywa kosztowne"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a9a4f93a-4542-4227-8769-480a2d7b4518",
                        "source_entry_id": "16b04fd1-09f5-35d8-b3b0-c4d683154de8",
                        "source_sense_id": "ee9f4aba-1e0e-36d5-bd8d-74f7e3617841",
                        "target_lang_word": "sceptic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sceptic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "818f29ff-94b2-3c7b-84a4-b9e17fc60959",
                                        "entry_id": "fac0c4b3-f31d-3f7d-9121-22eb5ee56bcb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of skeptic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sceptic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5a34f8fc-63db-39cb-a8aa-322cdeab6829",
                                        "entry_id": "e1ed4df8-7727-302b-84b1-96303190c856",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of skeptic."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d51d27a6-49e3-4f31-8714-1dfb646c64be",
                                                "sense_id": "5a34f8fc-63db-39cb-a8aa-322cdeab6829",
                                                "text": "Not long since O’Connell beat the sceptic geologists of the British Association of nonsense and “science” all to nothing by a discovery of fossil Whigs—very extraordinary and ferocious creatures they must have been in their day, which, of course, was far anterior to the creation of the world, according to the Mosaic account, which the bone-grubbing “philosophers” of the chalk formations have so properly exploded."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb9e1d94-a881-46e6-9018-37a0fdd9bda9",
                                                "sense_id": "5a34f8fc-63db-39cb-a8aa-322cdeab6829",
                                                "text": "The black race, much inferior to the Arab in intellectual power and in steadiness of will, are at the same time free from the sceptic distrustfulness and deep jealousy so common among their white fellow-citizens."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5fc5b24-a1c4-4a80-a775-67a079c427b7",
                                                "sense_id": "5a34f8fc-63db-39cb-a8aa-322cdeab6829",
                                                "text": "As I said, my experience was: I travelled to Russia as a sceptic person and I returned as a European."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "540b99a4-c916-407a-abe8-29dbf8fec73c",
                        "source_entry_id": "16b04fd1-09f5-35d8-b3b0-c4d683154de8",
                        "source_sense_id": "ee9f4aba-1e0e-36d5-bd8d-74f7e3617841",
                        "target_lang_word": "skeptic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "skeptic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                        "entry_id": "ca9f8a0e-8938-3978-b011-bde8dbf814af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who doubts beliefs, claims, plans, etc that are accepted by others as true or appropriate, especially one who habitually does so."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f95c4747-1e5f-4e3e-ae27-3c6b28119573",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "Skeptics of this alliance were proven right because this partnership lasted only for a few years. Once Albania broke off diplomatic relations […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4137fe2f-365a-46c5-ade5-dec047ead25d",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "But for the fly he might have made me think He had been at his poetry , comparing Nailhead with fly and fly with huckleberry : How like a fly , how very like a fly . But the real fly he missed would never do ; The missed fly made me dangerously skeptic.[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77c9c87a-0349-44b8-973b-b2f490bfa4bf",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "The official account of this meeting was that it ended in failure, with the Taliban's mullah Omar telling General Ahmed, “Osama will be the last person to leave Afghanistan.” The 9/11 skeptics believe that meeting was meant to fail."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e313e317-417b-4fa1-b3aa-6694100882f1",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "Even skeptics of the policy acknowledge that the Army conducted an exemplary insourcing program that successfully counteracted the Comptroller's budget ..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb6b6109-42b4-43e3-8563-9109a57e5d70",
                                                "sense_id": "aa8cbdd2-84c3-3d85-9150-66fd75208da1",
                                                "text": "The Buddha's perfect body is particularly important in these tropes, and it serves to persuade skeptics of his claims to ultimate authority."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3cecbf35-52e6-372e-8e00-ab2074e6f02d",
                                        "entry_id": "ca9f8a0e-8938-3978-b011-bde8dbf814af",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone who is skeptical towards religion."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "skeptic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e6164aa0-5c68-3820-8f51-7613bc1597e2",
                                        "entry_id": "a10754a8-de95-3ae1-b7b6-8c739a4d8813",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Skeptical."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec4c7879-2f0a-412c-857e-afbb53545ab4",
                                                "sense_id": "e6164aa0-5c68-3820-8f51-7613bc1597e2",
                                                "text": "This view of the Great Pyramid is being adopted by a widening circle of Christian believers, until even a skeptic scientist has dignified it as “the religion of the Pyramid!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0a6ac1b-aef6-47cb-bde4-a8735c57248f",
                                                "sense_id": "e6164aa0-5c68-3820-8f51-7613bc1597e2",
                                                "text": "No one but you can convince my heart, the stubborn, skeptic heart of mine to break the bad habit of breaking away."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0949748d-46af-46a1-b116-6c46b6058638",
                                                "sense_id": "e6164aa0-5c68-3820-8f51-7613bc1597e2",
                                                "text": "With an increase in divorce rates and half of them growing up with divorced parents, they have a very skeptic view of the concept of ‘happily ever after’."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4bdbe2b3-99ce-4096-9be5-a97bf1526e15",
                        "source_entry_id": "16b04fd1-09f5-35d8-b3b0-c4d683154de8",
                        "source_sense_id": "ee9f4aba-1e0e-36d5-bd8d-74f7e3617841",
                        "target_lang_word": "sceptique",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "sceptique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "796c3b7e-45fa-3bff-ab51-acaeed436f16",
                                        "entry_id": "8749c681-9d1d-3832-8468-c4b6e4afd617",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie les philosophes qui disent qu’il n’y a rien de certain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd702c1f-06dd-45fb-91bc-f5659c8147ed",
                                                "sense_id": "796c3b7e-45fa-3bff-ab51-acaeed436f16",
                                                "text": "Pyrrhon est considéré comme l’initiateur de la philosophie sceptique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf6e6c82-776a-4c2c-807e-dc279cef786a",
                                                "sense_id": "796c3b7e-45fa-3bff-ab51-acaeed436f16",
                                                "text": "Les philosophes sceptiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                        "entry_id": "8749c681-9d1d-3832-8468-c4b6e4afd617",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qualifie les personnes qui affectent de douter de tout ce qui n’est pas prouvé d’une manière évidente, incontestable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "common"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ca61de6d-023c-4e4c-bc9c-2d83efedc2f2",
                                                "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                                "text": "À force de rouler à travers les hommes et les pays, d’en observer les coutumes contraires, ses idées se modifièrent, et il devint sceptique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15e36dd2-65af-4c17-8b08-ac4780cd36d3",
                                                "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                                "text": "C’est un homme, un écrivain, un esprit sceptique."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "028be6cb-a3cf-467b-ad05-135c748a3d39",
                                                "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                                "text": "Être sceptique, rester sceptique : douter d’une chose."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "00cf56e1-c711-4570-8a47-4b19702f685e",
                                                "sense_id": "8645fb83-6d06-3248-bbdd-410ba2abe902",
                                                "text": "Cette nouvelle m’a laissé sceptique."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "sceptique",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c85b8d6a-8c39-3757-8382-d22bfc80c477",
                                        "entry_id": "a92d89df-d9b4-3b44-809a-dc8b9198f23a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui doute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e8e987d-e764-40e3-8e5c-80dce6c8f795",
                                                "sense_id": "c85b8d6a-8c39-3757-8382-d22bfc80c477",
                                                "text": "Les subtilités de l’ontologie ont fait tout au plus des sceptiques ; c’est à la connaissance de la nature qu’il était réservé de faire de vrais déistes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3dd7fc5e-4a56-417a-87bc-dc82d3b40381",
                                                "sense_id": "c85b8d6a-8c39-3757-8382-d22bfc80c477",
                                                "text": "En tant que sceptiques, nous avons observé qu’en général les gens tiennent à leurs croyances pour des raisons liées à certains besoins émotionnels."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b487efc8-84da-430c-8b18-a68f7b297a0f",
                                                "sense_id": "c85b8d6a-8c39-3757-8382-d22bfc80c477",
                                                "text": "Pyrrhon, bien qu’il n’en souhaitât pas, ni le contraire bien sûr, eut des disciples aux noms différents : les zététiques cherchaient la vérité sans relâche, les sceptiques examinaient tout sans jamais rien trouver, les éphectiques suspendaient leurs jugements, les aporétiques s’affirmaient incertains, y compris de leurs incertitudes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a43c9213-ca7c-34eb-ba33-314cf08e249a",
                                        "entry_id": "a92d89df-d9b4-3b44-809a-dc8b9198f23a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "(au féminin) Philosophie pyrrhonienne du doute."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0370014e-2e8f-42ac-b8e9-04f358ecc3e2",
                                                "sense_id": "a43c9213-ca7c-34eb-ba33-314cf08e249a",
                                                "text": "Selon cela les doutes de la sceptique établiront le milieu de la vertu intellectuelle, examinant les raisons qui proposent de tous côtés, sans rien déterminer que sur le vraisemblable seulement, et avec sa suspension ordinaire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
